  "description": "<p><strong>Ascent Labs</strong><br>Better impact through novel, research-backed products.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong></p>\r\n<p>At Ascent Labs, we are neuroscience researchers and formulation chemists, insistent on the idea that better supplements, designed by better research, can help more people live better, healthier lives. We bring a combined decade of research in our field and currently prioritize improving sleep health for as many people as possible through our novel Instant Sleep melatonin nasal spray. We've helped hundreds of customers reach consistent, restful sleep in spite of the challenges day-to-day life may throw their way. From first responders and nightshift workers to elderly patients, we've seen how helping people get better sleep is truly foundational to helping them live better lives, and we're working hard to broaden our impact to as many new niches as possible.</p>\r\n<p>We do things right at Ascent Labs. We maintain the highest production standards and take pride in the fact that we make each product in-house, in small batches, all so that we can insure that we continue to deliver on our promise of fast-acting, safe supplements.</p>",
